      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BRUREE LUCK (3) jumped from a middle draw last time and could manage only fifth and beaten 2 lengths (17.14) at this track. The form out of her last race has been franked. Looks the one to beat on her best form. THERMAL IGNITION (5) finds it hard to win. Finished third (17.08) at this track latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Solid record here winning two races. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from six attempts. Expected to be in the finish again. BLAZING GIRL (1) was a strong course and distance winner last time, claiming a Bottom Up - Grade 5 in a powerful 17.01 and a new PB here. Has the ability and can measure up again. ASTON FULHAM (2) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at his latest outing at this circuit.",
